Cell["\<\
Dropping the far vertex breaks inextensibility, so the truncation is no \
longer a ray.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"1d1f25f1-08f6-48e8-95a0-a57e111c9ac5"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
